      	 <div type="translation" resp="part:emfr">
      	 	
      	 	<p n="1">
      	 		Prosperity! Fortune!
      	 	</p>
      	 	
      	 	<p n="2-4">
      	 		Kattaiyaṉ, son of Iṟaiyamaṉ of Tōkkaipāṭi, became weak <supplied reason="explanation"><foreign>īṭṭupaṭṭān</foreign><note>That is, died.</note></supplied> <supplied reason="subaudible">during</supplied> a cattle-raid in Tōkkaipāṭi.
      	 	</p>
      	 	
